Syntax: aura guardian

The Aura of the Guardian embodies the deikhan's sacred duty to protect those
under their charge. By projecting this aura, the deikhan calls upon divine
power to shield allies from harm and bolster their ability to withstand
punishment.

While projecting this aura, all group members in the room benefit from
increased hit points, enhanced protection against all damage types, and
improved ability to avoid attacks entirely. Deikhans themselves receive
an additional bonus to protection, reflecting their special connection
to this defensive blessing.

The Guardian aura is particularly valuable when the party faces powerful
enemies capable of dealing massive damage. The combination of extra health
and damage mitigation can mean the difference between victory and defeat.

Only one aura may be projected at a time. Activating a new aura replaces any
currently active projection. The aura affects all group members in the same
room as the deikhan.

